<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'About — Evo Meals' }) %>
<meta name="description" content="Evo Meals is a Kuwait-based school meal management platform connecting schools, parents, students, and catering partners through subscriptions, digital ordering, tap-to-collect, and real-time reporting.">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/sitenav', { active: 'about' }) %>

<section class="hero hero-inner-page">
  <div class="wrap-wide">
    <div class="hero-copy" data-reveal style="max-width:680px;">
      <span class="eyebrow on-dark">About Evo Meals</span>
      <h1>Because "did you eat?" shouldn't be a guess.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Evo Meals started with a frustration every parent in Kuwait knows — sending a child off with lunch money and just hoping. We built the platform we wished existed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap what-is-wrap">
    <div data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Our story</span>
      <h2>From one family's frustration to a school-wide platform.</h2>
      <p>Hoping it was enough. Hoping they actually ate instead of skipping the line. Hoping the allergy you'd mentioned a dozen times was remembered by whoever was serving that day. That was the everyday reality for parents across Kuwait's schools — paper forms, WhatsApp coordination, cash in an envelope, and no way to know what actually happened at the lunch counter.</p>
      <p>Evo Meals exists to close that gap — not just for one family, but for an entire school community at once. What began as a way to give one parent visibility into one child's lunch has become a platform connecting schools, parents, students, and catering partners through a single, real-time system.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="what-is-pillars">
      <div class="what-is-pillar" data-reveal data-reveal-group="about">
        <span class="what-is-num">Our focus</span>
        <strong>Kuwait's schools</strong>
        <span>Built specifically for how school meal programs actually run here — not adapted from a generic food-delivery product.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="what-is-pillar" data-reveal data-reveal-group="about">
        <span class="what-is-num">Our approach</span>
        <strong>Partnership, not just software</strong>
        <span>We work with schools and caterers on menus, onboarding, and operations — not just a license and a login page.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="what-is-pillar" data-reveal data-reveal-group="about">
        <span class="what-is-num">Our standard</span>
        <strong>Allergen information, per dish</strong>
        <span>Every dish carries its own allergen information, so you can check before you book — not a blanket guarantee across the whole menu, and not independently verified.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-tint">
  <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center; max-width:640px;">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center;">Get in touch</span>
    <h2 style="margin:16px 0 14px;">Whether you're a parent, a school, or a caterer —</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--navy-800); font-size:15.5px; margin-bottom:28px;">We'd like to hear from you.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Contact us</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/sitefoot') %>

</body>
</html>
